哭而過市，曰：『天乎！襄仲爲不道，殺適立庶！』市人皆哭，魯人謂之『哀姜』。魯由此公室卑，三桓彊。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","quote":"定公立，趙簡子問史墨曰：『季氏亡乎？』史墨對曰：『不亡。季友有大功於魯，受鄪爲上卿，至于文子、武子，世增其業。魯文公卒，東門遂殺適立庶，魯君於是失國政。政在季氏，於今四君矣。民不知君，何以得國！是以爲君慎器與名，不可以假人。』"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p074","quote":"二十五年春，鸜鵒來巢。師己曰：『文成之世童謠曰「鸜鵒來巢，公在乾矦。鸜鵒入處，公在外野」。』"}],"rationale":"按懿公被弒至魯文公的敘事角色、同段明示子／弟與柯盟、齊襄公殺魯桓公、晉立惠公等具體事件暫定異稱；同字爵稱依國別分開。公子揮不與前篇公子翚、晉襄父不與晉襄公、宣伯不與叔孫宣伯自動合併。數位疑讀與親屬異說仍待核對。 第74段文成之世依本卷此前文公與成公敘事作合稱暫解，不把文、成作全域個人名匹配。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p052","text":"三十三年，釐公卒，子興立，是爲文公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m052-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m052-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"興","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m052-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p053","text":"文公元年，楚太子商臣弒其父成王，代立。三年，文公朝晉襄父。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m053-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m053-0005","start":5,"end":10,"surface":"楚太子商臣","kind":"person","person_id":"2d3_fsd_1dh_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m053-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"2d3_fsd_1dh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m053-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu